The data comes from the Minut sensors and homes of the user, through the
official Minut API (https://developer.minut.com,
https://api.minut.com/latest/docs), with the API client of the user.

The files under test/fixtures are built after the OpenAPI reference of the
Minut API v8 and the examples of its guides.

Minut and the Minut logo (shown on the cover image, cover.jpg and
docs/assets/cover.svg, to name the service the integration connects to) are
trademarks of their owner. This community integration is not affiliated with,
endorsed or sponsored by Minut.
